# Line endings: store text with LF and check it out with LF on every platform.
#
# Use text=auto, never a bare "* text": text=auto lets git detect binary files
# and leave them alone, whereas "* text" forces every file through end-of-line
# conversion. That is how commit 646bd87 ("Renormalize line endings") stripped
# CR bytes out of the PNGs and validation/HART_II/pressure_plot.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch files need CRLF to run reliably under cmd.exe.
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary formats in the repo, spelled out so no heuristic can misjudge them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
*.mat binary
*.fig binary
*.pptx binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
validation/HART_II/pressure_plot binary
wing_test/data binary
